It is Monday morning.
It is February in Berlin.
I am sitting in my flat.
I look at my calendar.
I have plans almost every day.
I sometimes have a lot to do.
I am going to the gym on Tuesday.
I also go on Thursday.
I always train at half past five.
That is my routine.
But this week I need two more appointments.
I need a haircut.
And my bicycle is unfortunately broken.
I need a repair shop for my bicycle.
I take my phone.
I am looking for a phone number for the hair salon.
My week is really full.
